// inside the polynomial fragment (a bare component read IS a polynomial), so
// since the radical-vector Lie discharger landed, the engine gets the last
// word and proves the stronger statement: `x(2)` is not merely a
// basis-dependent read, it is a map that provably fails Df(x)(A x) = A f(x)
// at the very first generator. That is the designed exit — a discharge
// failure REPLACES composition's diagnostic — and it is the only place in the
